  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development would result in a significant loss of historic fabric which is without clear justification or wider public benefit. This is considered harmful to the character and setting of the listed building and is contrary to the aims and objectives of Policy 71 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024), which seeks to ensure that development conserves and enhances any features of architectural interest.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Due to to insufficient information the proposed alterations fail to address the full design implications of the proposal in relation to the external staircase, therefore without evidence to the contrary the design is not confirmed to be in accordance with Policy 53 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
